2026-11-08T22:57:03.3189217Z             "body": "## Consolidated implementation handoff — 2026-11-08\n\nFinal HEAD: `4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551`. Main baseline: `2e4fe5d8cb0f39170b0d789fdd7e07be4ac0219a`. PR remains **draft; PARTIAL/BLOCKED; Sprint 1 NOT COMPLETE**.\n\nAll six pinned source heads (#80, #81, #82, #83, #84, #86) are ancestors through proper three-way merges; main already contains #85. Source branches and main were not modified. Semantic conflicts preserve ETL, ownership/RBAC, migration guards, policy, workspace/theme and Incidents UI retirement.\n\n### Changes and evidence\n\n- Additive migration 0042, immutable tenant-scoped source revision ledger, actor/time/hash/provenance, source expected-revision/idempotency commands and transactional legacy attachment adapters.\n- Typed host OS/method and explicit HTTPS applicability; unverified/incompatible/excluded configurations fail closed. New-revision rollback revalidates and never activates collectors or restores secrets/checkpoints.\n- Approved single-panel three-level navigation, tenant/session reload safeguards, actual API/browser configuration tests and desktop captures.\n- Preserve all 28 workflows and 13 required checks; no retired coverage. Source configuration acceptance and tamper-resistant evidence checks added.\n- [Report and commands](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/REPORT.md), [merge decisions](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/MERGE_RESOLUTIONS.md), [changed files](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/CONSOLIDATED_CHANGED_FILES.txt), [source identities](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/TESTED_SOURCE_SHA256.json).\n- [1,273 artifact checksums](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/ARTIFACT_SHA256.json), manifest SHA-256 `37c06b2fda5a6e8fc67fde957334a80c0badee2f121947b430b0209c503ccc88`.\n\n### Actual local results — overlapping suites, not additive\n\n| Suite | Result |\n|---|---|\n|Broad PostgreSQL discovery|662 executions: 594 PASS, 0 FAIL, 68 SKIPPED|\n|Owned ETL PostgreSQL/HTTP/browser|117 PASS, 0 FAIL/SKIP|\n|Final source configuration/ETL subset|38 PASS, 0 FAIL/SKIP|\n|Frontend|55 PASS; lint and production build PASS|\n|CI regression and workflow validation|24 PASS; all 28 workflows valid|\n|Full controlled HTTP/browser/restore/TLS|13 top-level groups PASS; 67 scope HTTP checks, 17 scope-browser groups, 7 closure-browser groups|\n|Operational/theme|PASS; 13 theme checks, 6 contrast measurements, no page/server errors|\n|Historical image policy|7 roles FAIL; unresolved vulnerabilities and pending licence review|\n\n642 unique backend unittest identities have PASS execution evidence after deduplication; 68 discovery skips remain skips and have separate owned execution evidence. Full suites tested 89f8a55; operational/release harness 76c53e9; final product follow-up 917da63; CI implementation 25cd3bf. Exact per-suite SHAs, failed attempts, raw logs, restore comparisons and scoped cleanup are retained. Documentation-only final commits do not relabel older hosted runs as final passes.\n\n### CI TRIGGERED — RESULT PENDING\n\nOne trigger snapshot only; no polling or completion monitoring. All runs below identify this exact final HEAD. Owner/reviewer must inspect actual final conclusions and uploaded evidence.\n\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Network Egress Isolation — 42513541951](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541951) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier A - Scope and Workflow Integrity — 42513541968](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541968) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Integrated Quality Regression — 42513541735](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541735) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Application Image and Worker Validation - No Deploy — 42513541704](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541704) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Image SBOM Vulnerabilities and Licenses — 42513541762](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541762) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Disposable Reliability and Recovery — 42513541886](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541886) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Operational Dashboard Integration — 42513541861](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541861) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier A - Source Tests Lint and Build — 42513541860](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541860) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Controlled HTTPS Alert Recovery — 42513541794](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541794) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Native Monitoring Contracts — 42513541869](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541869) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Sprint 1 Resource Workspace — 42513541827](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541827) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier C - Secrets and Dependency Security — 42513541772](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541772) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier A - UAT Controller Safety Contracts - No Deploy — 42513541795](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541795) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - PostgreSQL Migration and Authorization — 42513541856](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541856) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Customer Ownership and Access — 42513541838](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541838) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - PostgreSQL API and Browser Integration — 42513541859](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541859) — in_progress at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - ETL Ownership and Monitoring Contracts — 42513541771](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541771) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n- [OC Dev - Tier B - Private HTTPS Monitoring — 42513541866](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/actions/runs/42513541866) — queued at trigger snapshot; result PENDING.\n\n### Remaining blockers / decisions\n\n- Ruleset 26082467 additive update refused HTTP 403 “Resource not accessible by integration”; reread confirms original 13 checks, strictness, approvals and bypass actors unchanged. Minimum prerequisite: authorised GitHub App/token with repository Administration write, followed by drift and exact check-identity validation. No bypass or required-check removal.\n- All seven historical image roles retain security policy failures and pending accountable per-component licence/NOTICE/source-offer review. No suppression, threshold reduction, digest replacement or waiver. Fresh final images/scans await hosted evidence; local Docker build backing storage is insufficient.\n- [Open configuration gaps](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/OPEN_BLOCKERS.md): atomic resource-context/legacy writer cutover, full history/diff/detach/staged-draft UI, catalogue publication concurrency, exact command crash/revocation/application-provenance cases and provider-specific qualification.\n- **Owner visual acceptance requested** for [admin/operator desktop captures and deviations](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/tree/4081fc75117afbd43e1fc4489925a2d65d744551/docs/verification/sprint1-integration/VISUAL_ACCEPTANCE.md); prior rejected candidate is not treated as approved. **Independent engineering PR approval requested** before any merge decision.\n- Nine owner-acceptance selections, D07/D08, independent UAT and genuine-provider certification remain pending. No Sprint 2, merge, deployment, release approval, collector upgrade or changes to unrelated durability work.\n\n**CHK-001 FAIL · CHK-002 BLOCKED · SECURITY BLOCKED · RELEASE NO-GO.**\n\n<details>\n<summary>Previous PR description (historical context)</summary>\n\nOwner-approved consolidation against post-#85 main. Initial commit is an integration ledger only; **NO source branches merged yet**. Preserve ETL, resource lifecycle, tenant/RBAC, PostgreSQL, scope and security gates. Pending semantic conflict resolution, template contracts, full authenticated/PostgreSQL CI, owner visual acceptance, and independent review. Do not merge this draft until all gates pass. See docs/verification/sprint1-integration/INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md.\n</details>\n",
